  "all_ingredients_flat": "1 cup ragi flour (finger millet flour), 1 cup quinoa flour, shredded carrots, water",
  "instructions": "PUTTU FLOUR: Mix the flours. Keep adding water 1 teaspoon at a time to form a soft dough. We should be able to bind it using our fingers as shown in the pic.\nPUTTU: In a ramekin cup, assemble the puttu in four layers: bottom layer is shredded carrots, followed by a layer of puttu flour, followed by a layer of shredded carrots; the final layer is puttu flour on top.\nCOOK: Steam for at least 20-25 minutes. Let it cool down for couple of minutes. Then transfer it onto a plate for serving.",
